Validation Engine Design
The wizard validates the following:

Validation 1. Field presence. All required fields must be present.

Validation 2. Field value. All values must be in the permitted set.

Validation 3. Field type. All values must be of the correct type.

Validation 4. Consistency. All consistency checks must pass.

Validation 5. Schema. The assembled specification must conform to the schema.

Validation 6. Completeness. All items must be stated (in strict mode) or stated or marked as not_determinable with a justification (in advisory mode).

